?\\nThis way leads to Kanto...\\fBut this path’s blocked for\\fthe time being, I’m afraid.","msg_0361_R22R0101_00005":"Hold there!\\rThis way leads to Kanto...\\nBut this path’s blocked for\\fthe time being, I’m afraid.\\r","msg_0361_R22R0101_00006":"West to Mt. Silver.\\nEast to the Kanto region.\\rGo north for the Elite Four!\\nBut you should know that already,\\fsince you defeated the Champion!","msg_0361_R22R0101_00007":"Janine: I’m on the way to my dad’s\\nhouse to give him his lunch.\\rThe Elite Four has no time to rest,\\nday or night. It’s such hard work,\\fyou know?\\rSay!\\nDo you want to exchange numbers? {YESNO 0}","msg_0361_R22R0101_00008":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} registered Janine\\nin the Pokégear!","msg_0361_R22R0101_00009":"Janine: Call me on Monday around noon\\nif you want to battle!","msg_0361_R22R0101_00010":"Janine: You don’t look like you’re\\nscared, but you are, aren’t you?","msg_0361_R22R0101_00011":"Janine: Now you want to know\\nmy number, don’t you? {YESNO 0}","msg_0361_R22R0101_00012":"Janine: I’m done taking lunch to\\nmy dad, and now I’m on my way home.\\rDo you want to take a picture\\nwith me? {YESNO 0}","msg_0361_R22R0101_00013":"Janine: Can you look as cool as me\\nfor the picture?\\r","msg_0361_R22R0101_00014":"Janine: Don’t you think we look\\ngood in the picture?","msg_0361_R22R0101_00015":"Janine: That’s a pity!","msg_0361_R22R0101_00016":"Your Photo Album is full.\\rAccess your PC and delete\\nsome pictures."},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{"OnTransition":"_EV_scr_seq_R22R0101_007 + 1","OnResume":"_EV_scr_seq_R22R0101_006 + 1"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_R22R0101_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_R22R0101_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_R22R0101_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_R22R0101_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_R22R0101_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_R22R0101_005":5,"_EV_scr_seq_R22R0101_006":6,"_EV_scr_seq_R22R0101_007":7,"_EV_scr_seq_R22R0101_008":8,"obj_R22R0101_policeman":0,"obj_R22R0101_policeman_2":1,"obj_R22R0101_policeman_3":2,"obj_R22R0101_gsleader13":3}}
